    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>Q</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mi>C</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is"
